2f780e2f, https://si.imgix.net/0190382d/uploads/origins/2c4b0d05-dda3-461e-84e3-6d117004a9e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc0b38835081f3a1274102049b94ca6e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0190382d/uploads/origins/2c4b0d05-dda3-461e-84e3-6d117004a9e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01dc2f6f86ada6c170850ac459143ead 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵はとてもかわいいです！ 私のキャラクターを描いていただけたら嬉しいです。星歌は穏やかで賢いウサギです。ポーズはマイクを持って歌うポーズをお願いします。背景は自由です。背景ありの作品の場合は背景なしの人物のみの透過データも分けて納品していただけると助かります。\n\nモチーフ：うさぎ、星、月、雲、音楽\n\nこれを私のソーシャルメディアとYoutubeチャンネルに使用したいと思います。ありがとうございます。\n\nHello! Your arts are cute!\nWould you please draw my character Seica?\nShe is a calm, smart rabbit. I would like her holding a microphone for singing. You can choose any background.I would like to get two versions one with a background and one with a transparent background if possible.\n\nMotif: rabbits, stars, moon, cloud, music\n\nI would like to use this for my social media and Youtube channel. Thank you!\n\n参考Reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SoglOvz754ruwClhcSht1YhbZ5f70qML?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nannan_illust70/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f18a1594/uploads/origins/7909acdd-b3dd-4dc1-9fc6-dfe18d7057b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de94d1336c8f5c88b83163d78f565b92", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f18a1594/uploads/origins/7909acdd-b3dd-4dc1-9fc6-dfe18d7057b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de94d1336c8f5c88b83163d78f565b92, https://si.imgix.net/f18a1594/uploads/origins/7909acdd-b3dd-4dc1-9fc6-dfe18d7057b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2489cb39d7e5bab5f318480724fa1bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f18a1594/uploads/origins/7909acdd-b3dd-4dc1-9fc6-dfe18d7057b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&